    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, ginger garlic paste, lemon juice and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for a while.",
      "In a pan, add fenugreek seeds, coriander seeds, green cardamom, small mustard seeds, cloves, cumin seeds, black peppercorns, black cardamom, salt to taste and dry roast it for 2-3 minutes until aromatic.",
      "Turn off the flames and add turmeric powder, degi red chili powder and coriander powder.",
      "Transfer it to a mixer grinder jar and grind it into a fine powder.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add marinated chicken, koliwada masala, whole eggs, rice flour, cornstarch, degi red chili powder, oil and give it a good mix. Keep it aside to marinate for a while.",
      "In a kadai, add oil, once it's hot, drop the marinated chicken pieces and fry them until it's half cooked.",
      "Transfer it to an absorbent sheet and keep it aside to rest.",
      "Increase the flames to high, once it's hot, refry the chicken until crispy and golden in colour..",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish, garnish it with onion rings, lemon wedge, green chili, coriander sprig and sprinkle some koliwada masala.",
      "Serve hot with green chutney."
    ],
